 parts of the Indo-Gangetic Plain. It borders the Tibet Autonomous Region of China to the north, and India to the south, east, and west, while it is narrowly separated from Bangladesh by the Siliguri Corridor, and from Bhutan by the Indian state of Sikkim. Nepal has a diverse geography, including fertile plains, subalpine forested hills, and eight of the world's ten highest mountains, including Mount Everest, the highest point above mean sea level on Earth. Kathmandu is the nation's capital and its largest city. Nepal is a multi-ethnic, multi-lingual, multi-religious, and multi-cultural sovereign state, with Nepali as the official language.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nepal","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"NP"}],"arc":{"reports":23,"first_seen":"2026-10-10T22:58:29Z","first_title":"Climate Solutions Company Treasure Carbon Brings Climate Finance to Nepal for Long-Term Climate Action","first_url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","first_publisher":"GlobeNewswire","earlier":[{"id":"e_6ff73f769775","title":"UN climate disaster fund moves to provide $20 mn aid for Nepal","date":"2026-10-22T14:37:33Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPWVE1TjQ5bFIxdHRwQjlsM25mRmgyNlctcWJ2aWZvZUpyTlZQVHRWdWtibTlIdVlPd0lrMUx4djVrejVxQ0xzSG9Wbk9JYVY5OEZqb0xLU1VGQktSMUY2bHZvY1BuUWJqX2F2aHFpMEtyMU1GSXZ2TEpaQU54LVBVb2tQOVFSQjlIOGNUMkhWY3hGem1UelFhTW4tcEo0ZGM?oc=5","publisher":"Arab News","verification":"multi_source_reporting"},{"id":"e_22c8d4d9b65d","title":"Loss and damage fund agrees $20m for Nepal but rich nations warn it should not set precedent","date":"2026-10-22T16:55:42Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"Climate Home News","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_26db20709ac6","title":"UN Climate Fund Votes to Help Nepal, a Historic Step Far Short of the Need","date":"2026-10-22T21:51:11Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNeHJmdlA2d0NRZjdudS16Y1lrOEZSRkdWbU5ydHUtaHo5ZTloZDVyTXNweklhRmFLdV